    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_20051215.0735\n\nPERTH, Australia, Dec 16 , 2005\n\nAustralia 96-1 against South Africa at lunch in first Test\n\n\n\n\nAustralia were 96-1 at lunch on the first day of the first cricket Test against South Africa at the WACA Ground here Friday.\n\nBrief score: Australia 96 for one (Ricky Ponting 57 not out, Justin Langer 33 not out; Ntini 1-34)",
